  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ICRC Emergency Appeal 2011</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ICRC Emergency Appeal 2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Genom detta st&#xF6;d bidrar Sida till att ICRC bland annat kan f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttra h&#xE4;lsosituationen f&#xF6;r utsatta m&#xE4;nniskor, ge skydd till vuxna och barn i konfliktsituationer, installera vatten - och sanitetssystem i s&#xE5;rbara samh&#xE4;llen, bes&#xF6;ka f&#xE5;ngar runt om i v&#xE4;rlden, samt forts&#xE4;tta spridning av information och &#xF6;ka respekten f&#xF6;r IHL (Internationell Humanit&#xE4;r R&#xE4;tt)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida support the ICRC to improve the health situation of vulnerable people, providing protection to adults and children in conflict situations, installing water - and sanitation systems in vulnerable communities, access to detainees around the world, and to continue the dissemination of information and compliance with IHL.</narrative>
  </description>
